{"id": "EUVD-2026-103008", "enisaUuid": "0831520d-40e5-3093-90ac-cbeb7cbde841", "description": "Arkon through 0.9.2 contains a broken access control vulnerability that allows authenticated employees to read and modify other departments' sources because by-id routes in app/routers/sources.py skip can_access_document. Attackers can call the plan, progress, PATCH, retry and approve-extraction routes with foreign source IDs to disclose derived wiki titles and summaries and alter ingestion state.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:40:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:16:33", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/arkon-wiki-graph-cross-department-idor", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/routers/sources.py#L644-L673", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/routers/sources.py#L295-L312", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/routers/sources.py#L257-L275", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/arkon-through-0.9.2-broken-access-control-via-sources-by-id-routes"], "aliases": ["GHSA-r63c-wh5x-45mr", "CVE-2026-111716"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8a8e11a8-c364-3082-826f-8377b52f2a56", "product": {"name": "arkon", "vendor": {"name": "nduckmink"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.9.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4f27b8c5-68ad-3657-af96-e817731d7978", "vendor": {"name": "nduckmink"}}], "isExploited": false}